It would also load fine with the standard debian 2.2.x kernel, but when
i switched to 2.4.x kernel i compiled myself I got filesystem errors.
It turned out that the 2.4.x kernel would cause very bad filesystem
corruption on any ide drives connected to the builtin CMD686(?)
controller.
